    <string name="onboarding_title_1">Your Words — in Blocks</string>
    <string name="onboarding_desc_1">Group words into small blocks — it\'s much easier to learn this way. Create your own lists from words you pick or add suggested ones.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_2">Reinforce and Grow</string>
    <string name="onboarding_desc_2">Complete quick quizzes to turn new blocks into learned ones. All your progress is tracked in simple statistics.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_3">Review &amp; Master</string>
    <string name="onboarding_desc_3">Need extra practice? Manually add any word to your Review Block to keep it in your daily rotation until you\'ve fully mastered it.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_4">A Marathon, Not a Sprint</string>
    <string name="onboarding_desc_4">To ensure better retention, we limit learning to 3 blocks at once. 1 new block per day plus 1–2 review blocks. A little bit every day goes a long way!</string>
